<title>MOROCCO: Moroccan firm Financiere Diwan profits up in 96.</title>
<headline>Moroccan firm Financiere Diwan profits up in 96.</headline>
<dateline>RABAT 1997-03-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Moroccan portfolio management firm Financiere Diwan said on Monday it has registered provisional net profits of 88.9 million dirhams ($9.5 million) in 1996 from 34 million dirhams in 1995.</p>
<p>They gave no figures for the turnovers of 1996 and 1995.</p>
<p>Financiere Diwan, is a subsidiary of Moroccan conglomerate ONA group, which manages the holding's share portfolio in banking and insurance sectors.</p>
<p>It was last traded on the stock exchange at 359 dirhams on March 28.</p>
